      "writtenOn": "2025-01-28T00:52:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is `properties.driverVersion`, but I don\u0027t know which driver version fixed the issue the workaround was for.  The comment only mentions api level 28 (Android P) on a few devices.\n\nWhile this CL is also incorrect technically, it seems better to disable android-specific workarounds for non-Android builds by default.  We can re-enable them based on driver versions if we ever run into regressions.",
      "parentUuid": "3185dfe0_7aa1e5e4",
      "revId": "de40dde12c41b4cf3b61482d0e21c5e040ea4efe",
